        <mxCell id="16" value="M1 annotations&#10;Screen type: List.&#10;Field→column: every table column is a ticket column, or issue_category.category_name via FK; customer_phone shown FULL (Center Manager, QT-15).&#10;Actions: [Assign] opens M2 (UC3 entry); [Apply filters] = FR9.&#10;States: empty state = US1 AC2 (AC-driven visible state, not a written exception flow); generic message area covers unexpected errors incl. 403 (the 403 itself is documented in the API contract).&#10;UC1 has no written exception flows, so no further error slots are required (check-6 obligation set = written flows of UC3/UC4)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
