        <mxCell id="18" value="M2 annotations&#10;Screen type: Detail (hosts UC2 suggestion + UC3 assignment).&#10;Field→column: summary = ticket columns; table = technician.ho_ten and technician_skill.proficiency; workload is COMPUTED at query time (statuses DA_PHAN_CONG / DANG_XU_LY / CHO_LINH_KIEN) and is never stored.&#10;Reason input → ticket_status_log.note (write path).&#10;Buttons: [Confirm assignment] = UC3 step 6; [Schedule appointment] = UC4 entry, enabled once an assignment exists.&#10;Master-data note: technician / technician_skill / issue_category are imported from the case-study dataset; no admin screen in v0.5 (NFR7 insert-only)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
