        <mxCell id="17" value="M3 annotations&#10;Screen type: Create/Edit.&#10;Field→column: loai, ngay_hen, gio_bat_dau, gio_ket_thuc are appointment columns; ticket_id, technician_id, center_id are system-derived from context (NOT entered); trang_thai is set by the confirm action.&#10;Conflict check excludes the appointment being updated and ignores HOAN_TAT / KHACH_HUY / KHACH_KHONG_DEN.&#10;Absent by design: location and ghi_chu/note (deferred); KIEM_TRA_TAI_CHO option (deferred; enum kept in DB for historical rows)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
